# The herd's Tailshare tab: choosing several files and deleting them at once (Boss, 2026-10-28: "I need an easy way to
# multi-select on the herd Tailshare tab. I need to delete multiple files at once."). Made-up files only: with
# debug.soma.herdtest set, an emulator's sheep shows five test pocket files and two test texts and never reaches the
# real pocket on the Mac Pro (herd/Herd.kt herdTestMode; the real Fold ignores the prop). Run on the cover screen, then
# again unfolded (fold open). The sheep sits in home's bottom right corner: 0.85 0.77 on the cover (measured 2026-10-28,
# Mac Pro Fold8); unfolded, measure it from a shot first. A walk on the 2026-10-28 build found a long press here lifting
# the home widget underneath and closing the panel: home's tile long-press now leaves the herd panel alone.
shell setprop debug.soma.herdtest 1
shell am force-stop dev.omalauncher.boss
shell cmd statusbar collapse
key HOME
wait 2500
tap 0.85 0.77
wait 1500
tap Tailshare
wait 1200
expect test-alpha.txt
expect Test text one
shot tailshare-test-files
clearlog
# A long press starts choosing, with that file chosen; the bar shows the count.
hold test-alpha.txt
log herd select n=1
expect 1 selected
shot choosing-one
# Taps add more: two more pocket files and one text from "Sent to this phone".
tap test-charlie.txt
tap test-echo.txt
tap Test text one
log herd select n=4
expect 4 selected
shot choosing-four
# A tap on a chosen one takes it out again.
tap test-echo.txt
log herd select n=3
# Select all, then none, then all again.
tap Select all
log herd select n=7
expect Select none
tap Select none
log herd select n=0
tap Select all
log herd select n=7
# Back leaves choosing (the panel stays open), and nothing was deleted.
key BACK
log herd select off
expect test-alpha.txt
expect Tailshare
shot back-left-choosing
# Choose three, Delete, Cancel: still there.
hold test-bravo.txt
tap test-delta.txt
tap Test text two
log herd select n=3
tap Delete
log herd select n=3 confirm=Delete 3 files
expect Delete 3 files?
shot confirm-three
tap Cancel
nolog herd deleted
expect test-bravo.txt
# Delete, then the confirm's Delete them: the three go, the rest stay.
tap Delete
expect Delete 3 files?
clearlog
tap Delete them
log herd deleted 3 failed=0
absent test-bravo.txt
absent test-delta.txt
absent Test text two
expect test-alpha.txt
expect Deleted 3 files
shot after-delete
# A tap outside the files (the section header) leaves choosing.
hold test-alpha.txt
log herd select n=1
tap Pocket
log herd select off
shot outside-left-choosing
shell setprop debug.soma.herdtest 0
[phone] On the Fold, with real Pocket items Boss chose to delete: long-press one, tap more, Delete, confirm: they go from the pocket on the Mac and other devices too; nothing else does.
[phone] The bar and the confirm fit the cover screen and the unfolded one, in his look; the haptic buzz on the long-press feels right.
[phone] Back while choosing leaves choosing first; a second back closes the panel.
